## Important Note on the Timeout Issue

Separately from OAuth — Anthropic's FAQ confirms **claude.ai and Claude Desktop have a 300-second (5 minute) tool timeout**. Your single-lead generation tool with a 660-second timeout will get killed. Before submitting to Anthropic, that tool needs to be converted to the same async pattern as batch: return a job ID immediately, then the agent polls `get_list_status`. This is a separate ticket but it's a hard requirement for the Directory.

